<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>I miei ordini - MyClothes</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 20px; background: #f9f9f9; }
        .container { max-width: 800px; margin: auto; background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        th { background: #0070ba; color: white; }
        a { color: #0070ba; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <a href="/">← Torna alla Home</a>
        <h2>I tuoi ordini completati</h2>
        <p>Ecco la lista dei tuoi acquisti verificati automaticamente:</p>
        
        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>ID Ordine</th>
                <th>ID Transazione PayPal</th>
                <th>Importo</th>
                <th>Stato</th>
                <th>Data</th>
            </tr>
            {% for o in ordini %}
            <tr>
                <td>#{{ o.id }}</td>
                <td>{{ o.paypal_order_id }}</td>
                <td>{{ o.importo }} €</td>
                <td><b style="color: green;">{{ o.stato }}</b></td>
                <td>{{ o.data_ordine }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% else %}
            <tr>
                <td colspan="5" style="text-align: center;">Non hai ancora effettuato ordini.</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </table>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
